# Statements to keep out of the stream on an engine matrix run:
#   SQL_FILTER_FILE=corlogic.filter.engines
# One case-insensitive extended regular expression per line. A statement that matches is
# dropped before it reaches any side.
#
# REPLACE of a row that is already there is a delete plus an insert on one engine and one
# update in place on another, so the affected row count is 2 against 1 by design. The
# same holds for the row an ON DUPLICATE KEY clause rewrites.
^[[:space:]]*replace[[:space:]]
on[[:space:]]+duplicate[[:space:]]+key
